              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avandu viihiiri ya Asheri sivali vanyara kukunga avandu vamenya mu madaala ga Ako, Sidoni, Ahilabu, Achizibu, Heliba, Afeki na Rehobu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.31",
